  "ingredients": [
    "1 (8 ounce) package egg noodles",
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "1 (6 ounce) can sliced mushrooms",
    "1 cup chopped onion",
    "1/2 cup chopped celery",
    "2 cloves garlic",
    "1/2 teaspoon Italian seasoning",
    "1/4 teaspoon crushed red pepper",
    "1/4 cup dry white wine",
    "2 cups chopped cooked turkey",
    "1 (10.5 ounce) can condensed cream of mushroom soup",
    "1 cup sour cream",
    "3/4 cup reduced-sodium broth",
    "0.5 cup grated Parmesan cheese",
    "1/2 cup sliced almonds (Optional)"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease a 2-quart rectangular baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_omCCvrxVqYSRif2mJbgQYoedws=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/37784-easy-turkey-tetrazzini-ddmfs-0487-3x4-ingredients-8cf66266149d4eb8984c4f42b26c32a0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/37784/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add noodles; cook until al dente, 8 to 10 minutes. Drain pasta, transfer to the prepared baking dish, and cover to keep warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nKoZP9ZP_aHk5C3a__dSF81obHI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/37784-easy-turkey-tetrazzini-ddmfs-0489-3x4-step-02-33a5a4e7b40a4a7e843de9dc6418d8ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/37784/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a large, heavy skillet over medium-high heat. Add mushrooms, onion, and celery; cook until tender, 6 to 8 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/T4z9HfDA2CIPa0WxOKtbSow_WAY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/37784-easy-turkey-tetrazzini-ddmfs-0493-3x4-step-03-108f6f1714f84f29b920ec5fc0786627.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/37784/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add garlic, Italian seasoning, and crushed red pepper to the skillet; cook until fragrant, 1 minute more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KjwaCPqH3_vhaLBbgC7cZ2qpTdI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/37784-easy-turkey-tetrazzini-ddmfs-0500-3x4-step-04-78a6bc4d8df64a2385cd51f976fbcd43.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/37784/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add wine, stirring to scrape up any brown bits from bottom of the skillet; cook until most of the liquid evaporates, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-O0C8SpyZFxxTAqTxTfrRveSLQQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/37784-easy-turkey-tetrazzini-ddmfs-0506-3x4-step-06-d30a917dde77461089ae485457cfd6df.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/37784/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in turkey, soup, sour cream, and broth; cook until sauce bubbles, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9exqcbe1VBNhN3OlA7hcT0_mFtY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/37784-easy-turkey-tetrazzini-ddmfs-0516-3x4-step-07-bb2228c0570440078963753eb27f8c3d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/37784/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon turkey mixture over pasta; sprinkle Parmesan cheese and almonds on top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/quuU90Yz8cR5JANq-XRdCobEfeQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/37784-easy-turkey-tetrazzini-ddmfs-0521-3x4-step-08-73a891639ab2421280ca989eeef7920a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/37784/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until hot and bubbly, about 25 minutes. Let stand for 10 minutes before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sWsWjHzypJmZHFpEpo-kOSq8N38=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/37784-easy-turkey-tetrazzini-ddmfs-0526-3x4-step-09-dfa8603c8cc8455dbe9529ac53f2e74d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/37784/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
